<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<mxfile host="Electron" agent="Devalltect" version="29.0.0">
  <diagram id="astro-stage-1" name="01 — Protected exact artifact staging">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="760" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1200" pageHeight="760">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="title" value="01 — Protected exact artifact staging" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#142B3A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="25" width="1120" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="subtitle" value="The workflow is off by default; its one TAR upload does not grant Pages deployment or CMS completion." style="text;html=0;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;fontColor=#43566B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="78" width="1120" height="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b1" value="01  Trusted local proof inputs&#10;&#10;Frozen package / exact request&#10;Retained artifact proof + actual ZIP&#10;Go rechecks content and both hashes&#10;New public staging correlation UUID" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b2" value="02  Manual protected workflow&#10;&#10;Explicit opt-in; main; first attempt&#10;Environment review configured by operator&#10;Before-checkout ID / reviewed code guard&#10;No Pages or OIDC write permission" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b3" value="03  Fixed GitHub GETs&#10;&#10;Current repository / known workflow&#10;Exact successful first-run candidate&#10;Unexpired artifact ID / code / ZIP hash&#10;No caller repository or source URL" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b4" value="04  Credential-separated blob&#10;&#10;Private headers stay at api.github.com&#10;Canonical signed HTTPS artifact hosts&#10;Pin only fully public DNS answers&#10;No proxies / cookies / extra redirects" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b5" value="05  Exact in-memory reconstruction&#10;&#10;Portable bounded ZIP / CRC inventory&#10;Canonical Go gzip hash must match&#10;No extraction or site rebuild&#10;Stable run / artifact recheck before output" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b6" value="06  One prepared TAR upload&#10;&#10;Exclusive local artifact.tar&#10;Official run-scoped upload action&#10;Correlated name; one-day retention&#10;No website deployment or job success" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="footer" value="M5p · 8 November 2026 · Optional artifact staging only · No new migration · Deployment / CMS completion pending" style="text;html=0;align=left;fontSize=14;fontColor=#43566B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="665" width="1120" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#247F91;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b1" target="b2">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
