        <mxCell id="b3" value="03  Scope and operations&#10;&#10;No new migration; schema stays 25&#10;No API / Flutter screen / app version&#10;New public Go validation CI job&#10;No provider settings or tokens created" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b4" value="04  Explicit trust limits&#10;&#10;Local inputs / GitHub / TLS / runner&#10;Environment name is not configured review&#10;Unsigned request is not CMS approval&#10;No cross-run idempotence or stage budget" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b5" value="05  Next: Owner coordinator&#10;&#10;Permanent claims / audit / replay rules&#10;Current locked Owner / source / target&#10;Pin staging output to retained proof&#10;No provider I/O while SQL locks are held" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
